with attribution: Marmota electoralis, marmotaelectoralis.com.

What you may not do: copy the pages or their code and publish them elsewhere, whether
unchanged or modified, present them as your own work, or impersonate the author or the
project. Such use requires the author's written permission. GitHub's Terms of Service allow
viewing and forking this repository on GitHub, but grant no right to publish it elsewhere.

Marmot drawings: (c) 2026 Anna Stańczyszyn. All rights reserved, used with the artist's
permission. Screenshots of the pages showing the Marmot are fine, but the drawings themselves
may not be copied or used outside this project without her permission.

